# Sample Knowledge Base

This is a sample knowledge base for the free RAG chatbot demo.

## About the project

The RAG chatbot uses local embeddings and a local LLM.
It can answer questions based on uploaded documents and knowledge files.

## Features

- Works with text documents and PDFs
- Uses a local free LLM via Ollama
- Retrieves the most relevant chunks from the knowledge base
- Responds with grounded answers based on context

## Example answers

- This app is a local AI chatbot.
- It is designed for private document Q&A.
- It does not require a paid cloud LLM.
- Ollama is used for free local model inference.

## Common usage

You can place product docs, notes, FAQs, or internal guides in the data/knowledge folder.
The chatbot will use these files to answer your questions.
